<h3>DCAT-AP extended properties</h3>
DCAT-AP extends DCAT with a few properties. The used namespace <a href="http://data.europa.eu/r5r/"><code>http://data.europa.eu/r5r/</code></a>. 
In that namespace as general possible definitions of the additional DCAT-AP properties are provided to enable the use within DCAT-AP and possible beyond.


